s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118018.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds comprehensive unit tests for the `BitField` class (`core/templates/bit_field.h`), which currently has no test coverage.\r\n\r\n## Tests cover\r\n  - **Construction** — default (empty), from enum value, from integer\r\n  - **set_flag & has_flag** — single flag, multiple flags, idempotent double-set\r\n  - **clear_flag & clear** — clear a set flag, clear an unset flag (no-op), clear all\r\n  - **Bitwise combinations** — get_combined (OR), get_shared (AND), get_different (XOR), operations with empty operands\r\n  - **Type conversion** — implicit cast to enum, explicit cast to uint64_t\r\n \r\nContributes to #43440.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118018/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}